        "content": "<p>You are using <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=CategoryTheory.ComposableArrows.IsComplex.zero#doc\">docs#CategoryTheory.ComposableArrows.IsComplex.zero</a> in the expression <code>(longSequence_exact hS n _ rfl).zero 0</code> which uses <code>omega</code> to prove <code>0 + 2 ≤ 5</code>, and <code>omega</code> generates a proof which references <code>n₀</code>. If you provide your own proof of <code>0 + 2 ≤ 5</code> which does not use <code>n₀</code>, then <code>omit n₀ in</code> will work.</p>",
